	And I should be able to view the account external link "Salesforce Project"
	And I should be able to view the account external link "Zendesk Organization"
	And I should not be able to view the account external link "koroneikiautomotive-KoroneikiAutomotive"
	When I click on the "History" tab
	And the history entry with the keyword "Koroneiki QA Service Producer > Deleted External Link" with the field value "entityId" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
