	| Update Description          | Koroneiki QA Service Producer > Deleted External Link |
	| Update Field Name           | domain                                                |
	| Update Field Original Value | koroneikiautomotive                                   |
	| Update Field New Value      | N/A                                                   |

Scenario: View removed mapped external link
	Testing the ability to create a platinum subcription in Dossiera and adding and removing a mapped external link and viewing the removal of the external link in the provisioning account details page 

	Given I publish a project with no partner RabbitMQ message with routing key "dossiera.provisioning.create" with the following values
